{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haydee III</strong> is the long-awaited sequel in the Haydee series, which will connect the story of the first and second games. As before, it features a heroine trapped in a facility filled with secrets, traps, and foes. Six new themed zones will immerse you in a profound sense of being lost, doomed, and desperate. Draw your pistols and screwdrivers, and clear your pockets out of junk. A new challenge awaits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, intricate facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lack of resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail after fail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thrill of triumph</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And also mods, an editor, and the ability to climb on crates. Good luck!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Aimbot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3508770/66dd781e3a7e4e9e137681bcb5483118512e60fb.jpg"},{"name":"Bookworm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3508770/58b33983bb2fe460d1a37b80cb073ce77b1019b6.jpg"},{"name":"Catburglar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3508770/d5b4b161b13f8adb12e44af52aa7c676f6cdd690.jpg"},{"name":"Double Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3508770/b2c502c89a57e010aa85d7cdfb004b19b81771dd.jpg"},{"name":"Game Done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3508770/037921e1546c21eef2b00c335ce49dc2d7dedb5c.jpg"},{"name":"Lethal Weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3508770/2510b050a00